Fixed all three review findings:

- `tests/bench/mod.rs`: added an explicit child-environment hook and a start-marker handshake to `measure_in_child`; the hung-child test no longer uses `set_var`/`remove_var` and times from the marker instead of process startup.
- `tests/bench_test.rs`: the single-workload test now snapshots the default `bench_md_path()` and timing artifact, so a regression writing cwd `BENCH.md` would fail.
- `tests/bench/mod.rs`: added a structured `WRONG <expected-hex> <actual-hex>` worker line, parsed before the exit-status check, making `BenchError::WrongAnswer` reachable on the shipped child path. Added encoder/parser round-trip coverage.
- Updated `phases/phase-073/REPORT.md` to reflect the fixes and test count.

